{"labs": [{"stimuli": [{"id": 0, "type": "welcome", "contents": [{}], "template_override": 1, "_data": []}, {"id": 1, "contents": [{"value": {"audiosrc": "enpe7n1le02ob11re2aud01", "coverimg": "enpe7n1le02ob11re2img01.jpg", "images": [{"id": 0, "image": "enpe7n1le02ob11re2img01.jpg", "text": "<p><strong>Halley</strong>: Hello, Mike! Were you able to research about the PC Software Industry?</p>\n<p><strong>Mike</strong>: Hey, Halley! Yes. That's a very interesting subject.</p>\n<p><strong>Halley</strong>: Is the PC software industry successful thanks to the word processors?</p>\n<p><strong>Mike</strong>: Well, there are two key applications that revolutionized the software industry: spreadsheet programs and word processors.</p>\n<p><strong>Halley</strong>: Why are they so important?</p>\n<p><strong>Mike</strong>: They are responsible for triggering the growth of the mainframe and minicomputer software industry. Thanks to these applications, more people see how computers make our lives easy.</p>", "time": "100"}, {"id": 1, "image": "enpe7n1le02ob11re2img02.jpg", "text": "<p><strong>Halley</strong>: What are the origins of spreadsheet applications?</p>\n<p><strong>Mike</strong>: According to this web page, in 1979, Bricklin releases the first spreadsheet program after listening to his teacher saying that large companies divided blackboards into rows and columns for production planning. He thinks he can simplify this process by creating a program. So, Bricklin decides to try his invention on the Apple II. Not long after, there are imitations of the project, which helps revolutionize the accounting and financial management fields.</p>\n<p><strong>Halley</strong>: Does the word processor have the same popularity?</p>", "time": "42500"}, {"id": 2, "image": "enpe7n1le02ob11re2img03.jpg", "text": "<p><strong>Mike</strong>: Yes, as there are more and more microcomputers in the market, the relevance of creating an application that makes the writing process easier becomes a very important goal; later on, new technology advances allows users to edit on-screen and store the information on floppy disks. Finally, by 1976, Michael Shrayler releases the first-word processor for microcomputers, which is rudimentary, but commercially successful. After this program, new developments help the word processor become an even more popular application.</p>\n<p><strong>Halley</strong>: There is a lot to learn about the PC software industry! We are used to all this technology but we don't usually think about its origins and evolution.</p>\n<p><strong>Mike</strong>: Exactly! We must learn more!</p>", "time": "88200"}]}, "type": "slideshow"}], "title": "", "type": "audio", "template_override": 1, "_data": []}], "id": 0, "type": "scholar", "exercises": [{"id": 0, "template_override": 1, "type": "WLC", "questions": [], "stimuli_ids": [0], "img_path": "", "_data": [{"type": "instructions", "contents": [{"content": " I can discuss ideas about the starting point of the PC software industry.", "type": "Learning Outcomes"}, {"content": " I can talk about the origins of spreadsheet applications for microcomputers. ", "type": "Learning Outcomes"}, {"content": " I can talk about the origins of word processing programs for microcomputers.", "type": "Learning Outcomes"}, {"content": "Why were spreadsheet applications and word processors important for the PC software industry?", "type": "Free Header Item"}, {"content": "Why do you think spreadsheet applications and word processors were first invented?", "type": "Free Header Item"}]}, {"type": "group", "contents": [{"content": "Welcome", "type": "group_name"}]}, {"content": {"allowed_attempts": 2, "incorrect_feedback": [{"content": "try again", "type": "text"}, {"content": "Maybe next time", "type": "text"}], "attempt_feedback": [{"content": "You have 2 tries", "type": "text"}, {"content": "you have 1 attempt left", "type": "text"}], "correct_feedback": "Correct"}, "type": "feedback"}, {"content": "Ask your partner:", "t